{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dd07","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a986-16d4-7923-b79d-f784beb66015"},"sequence":3294,"recorded_at":1780531400006583,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f870b610-f41f-4227-a805-61cb8ebcb67d","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"f870b610-f41f-4227-a805-61cb8ebcb67d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f870b610-f41f-4227-a805-61cb8ebcb67d"},"terminal":"completed","text":"R2 rework handed off to review (`to-review`, 20/20 checklist).\n\nAll four rev1 findings are fixed at the root cause, with the reviewer's exact probes adopted as maintained regressions:\n\n- **F1** — Unregister is now stopped-only: a new `requireConfirmedStopped` gate requires a positive `.stopped` observation (unknown/missing/failed all refuse), enforced before the token mint and revalidated at the `config.sh remove` boundary. The UI confirmation matches (typed confirm only from `.stopped`).\n- **F2** — Apply binds server+scope+agentID+canonical service identity on the write path via `bindApplyIdentity`, re-checked at the PUT boundary, with session preservation (`sessionStill`) stopping silently on logout/account/server switch.\n- **F3** — Folder imports get collision-safe labels (`<name>-<path hash>`); duplicate labels refuse at both import and store level. The new per-runner-control test also exposed and fixed a latent spelling fragility: manifest identity now compares canonical paths (`/var` vs `/private/var`).\n- **F4** — Migration seals completion via a `migrated` flag (empty catalogs stay authoritative, legacy files seal in place); malformed/unreadable/unsupported stores fail closed instead of migrating or being overwritten.\n\nEvidence: 13 new tests, full suite 210 green (exit 0), 62 release tests green (exit 0), 8 narrowing mutants each killed at exit 1 with zero survivors (plus one honestly-labeled delete-only boundary check and one carryover), fresh signed 1.2.0 candidate (`BUILD SUCCEEDED`, codesign exit 0). Production runners untouched — both still running with no duplicate processes. Outcome attached as `TASK-260916-304bw2_catalog-lifecycle-r2-outcome.md`; candidate left uncommitted in the Story worktree.","reason":null}}
